5) RAINBOW-SOLID HIGHLIGHTING
FOR 256 COLOR DISPLAYS, THIS
CHANGES THE MOUSE HIGHLIGHTING
TO A SOLID COLOR.

6) DUNGEONS OF THE UNFORGIVEN
